---
manual: rules.blocks.window_changes_self
lines: [231, 244]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app title: "MAIN" do
  para self
  button "Spawn" do
    window title: "CHILD" do
      para self
    end
  end
end
----------- test code
main = Shoes.APPS.first
assert_equal [main.to_s], paras.map(&:text), "para self in the main app shows the main App"

find_button("Spawn").trigger_click

child = Shoes.APPS.last
refute_same main, child, "window opened a new App"
assert_includes paras.map(&:text), child.to_s, "and inside its block, self is that new App"
